### Enterprise Legal RAG Platform - Health & Readiness Checks
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Basic Health Check
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Deep Readiness Check (Probes SQLite, ChromaDB & Observability)
# @name readinessCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 3. Root API Welcome & System Metadata
# @name rootMeta
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 4. System Diagnostics (Safe operational metadata for Antigravity)
# @name diagnostics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics
Accept: application/json
